==English==

===Etymology===
{{compound|sea|shore|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|siˈʃoɹ|lang=en}}, {{IPA|siˈʃɔɹ|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[coastal]] [[land]] bordering a [[sea]] or an [[ocean]].
# The [[foreshore]], the strip of land between [[low water]] and [[high water]].

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|land bordering the sea}} [[seacoast]], [[sea marge]]
* {{sense|strip between high and low water marks}} [[foreshore]], [[intertidal zone]], [[littoral]]

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|land bordering the sea}} [[shore]], [[coast]]

